{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/K8Sy05GRRLSp931VTXYBxQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:30.601177+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/K8Sy05GRRLSp931VTXYBxQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>简 介</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>华东师范大学软件工程学院</span><span>（滴水湖国际软件学院）</span><span>“可信人工智能优秀大学生夏令营”活动定于2025年7月7日-12日，以线上线下相结合的形式举行。本次夏令营旨在促进高校间优秀大学生的交流，帮助优秀大学生加深对可信人工智能新技术的理解，开阔视野，激发科研兴趣，发掘科研潜力，并从中吸引优秀学生前来华东师范大学软件工程学院</span><span>（滴水湖国际软件学院）</span><span>攻读硕士、博士学位。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>现报名工作全面启动，欢迎各大高校的优秀大学生踊跃报名参加。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/WI1W1Io1203NiahmlaeroWps3zdlibiaPhviawMbTf4iaODj0DXDHJ7zFgxQ9mQLYJ0Wua18PPTtic93zNaNEp3chY6A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/O6z2fTzWS1m1sDYBAiaySJhtiadlibz1RrSbubzxC3x5KnHWmya5QH8EY2UibQYibBiaOknTV0tKRgvIYaKN5fQVyTfQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名条件</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>优秀大学生夏令营主要面向全国高等院校（含本校）有志攻读博士、硕士研究生的优秀2022级（拟2026年夏毕业）在校本科生。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1. 拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>2. 立志成为博士层次学术创新型人才或高层次实践创新型人才；</span></p><p><span>3. 学习成绩优异，本科前三年学习成绩在所在专业年级总排名的前20%以内，能够获得所在学校推荐免试资格者优先；</span></p><p><span>4. 专业要求：软件工程、计算机科学与技术、人工智能、网络空间安全、电子信息、数学等相关专业；</span></p><p><span>5. 具有较强的英语听说和写作能力。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/O6z2fTzWS1m1sDYBAiaySJhtiadlibz1RrSbubzxC3x5KnHWmya5QH8EY2UibQYibBiaOknTV0tKRgvIYaKN5fQVyTfQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 报名程序及提交材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>申请人需即日起至6月28日12:00前在华东师范大学“研究生报考服务系统” 中进行网上报名(https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=4)，按</span><span>【学硕/专硕/直博】填写个人信息并上传材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>填写要求如下</span>：</span></p><p><span>1. 务必确保信息正确、完整、详细，填写常用邮箱；</span></p><p><span>2. 填写科研成果时须注明完成人顺序、会议及期刊等级、投稿或发表状态等信息，团队获奖信息须注明参与顺序。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>上传的申请材料要求如下</span>：</span></p><p><span>1. 身份证正反面、优秀大学生夏令营申请表和诚信承诺书；</span></p><p><span>2. 个人介绍材料（整合成一个小于10M的PDF，要求制作封面及目录），包含：</span></p><p><span>（1）个人陈述（介绍本人的学习业绩、外语能力、获奖情况、论文发表情况、专业能力倾向、研究成果、学术研究兴趣、曾参与过的科研项目、创新意识创新能力、研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、其它特长及本人认为对于申请有参考价值的内容）；</span></p><p><span>（2）本科成绩单（前5学期）1份；</span></p><p><span>（3）佐证材料（如：英语等级证书、论文发表、专利发明、各类获奖或资格证书等扫描件）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>以上材料纸质版无需邮寄，入围线下交流营员在报到时提交。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/O6z2fTzWS1m1sDYBAiaySJhtiadlibz1RrSbubzxC3x5KnHWmya5QH8EY2UibQYibBiaOknTV0tKRgvIYaKN5fQVyTfQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>主要活动与日程安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1、报名时间</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>即日起至</span><strong><span>2025年6月28日（周六）12:00</span></strong><span>，之后申请通道关闭。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>2、名单确认</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院将审核申请学生材料，经评估后确定100位左右夏令营学员名单，将于7月上旬前通过邮件的形式通知学员详细安排及要求。学生登录系统查询营员入围结果，并及时确认参加情况。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>3、日程安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WI1W1Io1201Y4teuicFBZLxm467X0PsGfCd8G1YnA1tOt3POGZqGiagvn4r1oO0fQMGpDwCD6v2q6482KNiaaqHEA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/O6z2fTzWS1m1sDYBAiaySJhtiadlibz1RrSbubzxC3x5KnHWmya5QH8EY2UibQYibBiaOknTV0tKRgvIYaKN5fQVyTfQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/WI1W1Io1200vHhv5ej4yjCP9DF0lUeHLt8uvJuGtIcA0xqbBlsWeQWrTK3vYJELMrQQb6icoQLnfTN6LSsg7oWw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>营员遴选与评价</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>夏令营将评选产生优秀营员，优秀营员的效力认定等另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/O6z2fTzWS1m1sDYBAiaySJhtiadlibz1RrSbubzxC3x5KnHWmya5QH8EY2UibQYibBiaOknTV0tKRgvIYaKN5fQVyTfQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>营员支持资助</span></span><span><span> </span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1. 本次活动不收取任何费用，请报名者自行安排食宿与交通，费用自理。</span></p><p><span>2. 营员在夏令营期间如发生医疗费用及个人行为导致的意外事故，由本人及其派出单位承担。建议营员酌情购买保险。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/O6z2fTzWS1m1sDYBAiaySJhtiadlibz1RrSbubzxC3x5KnHWmya5QH8EY2UibQYibBiaOknTV0tKRgvIYaKN5fQVyTfQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>咨询方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>联系人：徐老师</span></p><p><span>电 话：021-62235267</span></p><p><span>邮 箱：cdxu@sei.ecnu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>地 址：上海市普陀区中山北路3663号华东师范大学理科大楼B325</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/WI1W1Io1200e0XUYXCj9icgzCHEh4vcz7aIrh7SzLsHxoPKYg3ngcVdhqdO6cGLdWaItfINKrKvQANFRribHN6mw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/O6z2fTzWS1m1sDYBAiaySJhtiadlibz1RrSbubzxC3x5KnHWmya5QH8EY2UibQYibBiaOknTV0tKRgvIYaKN5fQVyTfQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>其他 </span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>学院在6月30日至7月4日开设可信软件国际暑期学校，有兴趣的同学可以关注华东师范大学软件工程学院微信公众号并查阅相关信息。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/WI1W1Io1201Y4teuicFBZLxm467X0PsGfs1c9JegMA3Uo0QVCFU3HgAMbOS1smd0Dce1FrQSWbrnm6D8zHsR4Iw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/O6z2fTzWS1m1sDYBAiaySJhtiadlibz1RrSbubzxC3x5KnHWmya5QH8EY2UibQYibBiaOknTV0tKRgvIYaKN5fQVyTfQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/O6z2fTzWS1m1sDYBAiaySJhtiadlibz1RrSbubzxC3x5KnHWmya5QH8EY2UibQYibBiaOknTV0tKRgvIYaKN5fQVyTfQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>编辑丨林彦</span></p><p><span>审核丨曹桂涛 张磊</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0Egj76lSPicXbCTgBVIialdvwWxbm21OZytaf8P6xK86NglUjbFn8agwwLkdNhBNdSRvMLtiaXKjEj7A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/WI1W1Io1203fUPibvfngTgvmqJfImdLBgfFgO5aDSWZt1KUOpMxU4t0yTQwznSkSVdibjYrIf1TLGqPdBHF6ic6MA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>华东师范大学软件工程学院</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>以学生为中心</span></p><p><span>以市场为导向</span></p><p><span>以创新求发展</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>点亮“在看” ！ </span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/mkVkUAXPjk4dE6vVueXJ5bA3eAEFCq3wzY4mejx5UZekibSaJVXEYNNVLuVNRTjKFKjzbPCH2o3vrTZAAUZUQ6A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"44813fdc3a4a9f9be4ab36443bb1fdf2b739967b2d32e827e45a93e80bda6f71","textLength":1385,"sourceSha256":"cbb1c2f702a628aa71f5b0a50ae9e0e51552a1469441b93ef7bcb20c3d9ac61f","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-324073a27a3d6066fd75","title":"2025年华东师范大学软件工程学院（滴水湖国际软件学院）2025年“可信人工智能优秀大学生夏令营”活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:30.601177+00:00"}
